            "block_content": "When an Employer working under the terms of this Joint Agreement performs Interior marble or interior polished stone masonry work, the terms of the District Council's Marble Agreement shall apply. However, it is understood that whenever such an Employer assigns employees to marble masonry who normally work under the terms of this Joint Agreement, the Employer shall pay the marble mason's gross rate of pay to such employees less the fringe benefit contributions which shall be paid in accordance with the terms of this Joint Agreement.",
